From: Erik Stromdahl <erik.a.stromdahl@husqvarnagroup.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Mar 2025 21:40:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig: add overlayfs support

Signed-off-by: Erik Stromdahl <erik.a.stromdahl@husqvarnagroup.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig
index 8ab7fb986833..55076fe68c0e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_defconfig
@@ -1108,7 +1108,7 @@ CONFIG_QFMT_V2=y
 CONFIG_AUTOFS4_FS=y
 CONFIG_FUSE_FS=m
 CONFIG_CUSE=m
-CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS=m
+CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS=y
 CONFIG_VFAT_FS=y
 CONFIG_NTFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_NTFS_RW=y
